### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

May 3, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-23-23 for furnishing Aggregates on an annual
basis, for the City of Cheyenne, Street & Alley Division
 ______________________________________________

Three (3) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Three (3) bids were received from:

1.
JTL Group Inc. d/b/a Knife River (Cheyenne, WY)
2.
Simon Contractors (Cheyenne, WY)
3.
Croell Inc. (Cheyenne, WY)

The bids were reviewed by Bill Gonzalez (Street & Alley), Mike Schlabs (Street & Alley), Craig
LaVoy (Public Works), and Vicki Nemecek (Public Works).

Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from JTL Group Inc. d/b/a Knife
River. for the purchase of Aggregates on an annual basis, for a total cost of $40,000.00 for 5,000
Tons.

*Note* The Board of Public Utilities (BOPU) Requested 6,000 Tons of Aggregate under this bid
also.  They will be awarding their portion ($48,000.00) separately.

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-32303 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Sand & Aggregates)

$40,000.00
```

